module detroit_regulated_use_eligibility is
  concept Applicant
  concept RegulatedUseApplication
  concept Property
  concept DelinquentObligation
  concept BlightViolation
  concept RegulatedUseSite
  concept SpacingWaiver
  relation filed_by is from RegulatedUseApplication to Applicant end
  relation concerns_property is from RegulatedUseApplication to Property end
  relation delinquent_on is from Applicant to DelinquentObligation end
  relation obligation_from is from DelinquentObligation to BlightViolation end
  relation acquired_by_foreclosure_or_deed_in_lieu is from Applicant to Property end
  relation authorization_corrects is from RegulatedUseApplication to BlightViolation end
  relation waiver_for is from SpacingWaiver to RegulatedUseApplication end
  measure boundary_distance_to is for RegulatedUseApplication, RegulatedUseSite value Length end
  predicate legally_established(RegulatedUseSite)
end
